			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1112,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement authentication provider registration and session retrieval\n\nIntroduce two new gRPC handlers in the CocoonService authentication module to fulfill the Vine protocol contract for account management. Implement `RegisterAuthenticationProvider` to ingest provider metadata (ID, label, extension context) and register a `ProviderRegistrationDTO` in the `ApplicationState` extension store, generating a deterministic hash handle for lookup. Add `GetAuthenticationSession` to retrieve sessions by provider ID, currently returning an empty response as the full OAuth browser flow is pending implementation.\n\nThese handlers enable the Cocoon extension host to dynamically register authentication providers (e.g., GitHub, Microsoft) and query for active sessions, bridging the gap between the VS Code extension model and Mountain's state management.",
			"SHA": "a2dbe916245496da587e3fd77c25c40fb147f33a"
		},
